ind":"update","title":"Demo Ver 1.4 Update","summary":"◇ Dungeon System Overhaul The dungeon system has been completely redesigned (the previous system has been removed). You now choose your route on a map, which reduces the influence of luck and makes your choices more strategic. Visual effects have also been greatly enhanced for a more immersive experience. * About existing save data If you load a save made partway through the dungeon, the map will start over from Layer 1. Your party's status, including HP, items, skills, and equipment, will carry","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-13T05:51:25Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067942977","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3736800-1844115010498926","game_id":"steam-3736800","kind":"update","title":"Demo Ver 1.3 Update","summary":"◇New Features- Difficulty Setting The difficulty can now be changed in town. Hard is the same difficulty as before. Normal reduces all enemies' ATK and bosses' HP. - Retire You can now retire and return to town immediately (this counts as a game over). ◇Balance- Common Skills from the Astrolabe (Petit Fire / Petit Ice / Petit Volt) Required Aether lowered from 600 to 500. ◇Bug Fixes- Fixed an issue where no audio was recorded by Steam's recording feature when the recording source was set to \"Gam","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-20T13:41:00Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844115010498926","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3736800-1843481262696763","game_id":"steam-3736800","kind":"update","title":"Demo Ver 1.2 Update","summary":"◇New Features・Added Steam Overlay support, so screenshots (F12) and other overlay functions now work.◇Improvements・Improved the on-screen control guide when playing with a keyboard. Added right-click icons (Back / Menu) Only Main Keys are shown now (Sub Keys are hidden)・On LevelUp / Skill Scroll, skills you already have no longer appear as options (as long as skills you don't have yet remain).・Autosave now also runs after obtaining a skill.・Changed the condition for a character's name turning re","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-12T01:00:38Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262696763","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3736800-1842846814455622","game_id":"steam-3736800","kind":"update","title":"Demo Ver 1.1 Update","summary":"Demo Ver 1.1 Patch Notes ◆ Fix for the game failing to launch- Fixed an issue where the game failed to start in some environments.(It was caused by a conflict over a cache folder shared with other games built on the same engine.) - Depending on the environment, this may not fully resolve the problem. If the game stillwon't start, a report on the Steam forums would be a great help.- If you already applied the temporary workaround posted on the forums, you can simply keepplaying. No further action","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-08T13:18:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814455622","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3736800-1842846814449993","game_id":"steam-3736800","kind":"announcement","title":"\"Dungeon Picnic\" Demo Now Available for a Limited Time!","summary":"The demo lets you play through the first area and use four playable characters.Because some specifications differ, save data cannot be carried over to the full version.This demo is also confirmed for Steam Next Fest, starting October 19!Development toward the full release is well underway, so please look forward to further updates.Streaming GuidelinesLive streams of the \"Dungeon Picnic\" demo are welcome on all video platforms.Monetization features on those platforms (such as YouTube Super Chat) ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-06T00:44:12Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814449993","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:51:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-3736800":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:45:08Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T00:45:08Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-3736800":"2026-10-26T00:45:08Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"3736800":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:45:08Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:45:08Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5207170":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T00:45:08Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T00:45:08Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-3736800","app_id":3736800,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:14:21Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"8c09aaae15c6535cfcff83cde5061f16fb56b7d1dd4ee2c1d49a8cf72773fee9","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Dungeon Picnic is a fusion of RPG and roguelike - Enjoy only the best parts of an RPG.\r\nCombine allies and skills to build your own ultimate party.\r\nPick 4 pixel-art heroines and dive into the dungeon!","publishers":[{"name":"Lapismine"}],"developers":[{"name":"Lapismine"}]},"release":{"is_coming_soon":true,"custom_release_da